    "字符串",
    "动态规划"
  ],
  "summary": "把字符串分成若干互不重叠的字典单词，未覆盖字符算额外字符，求最少额外字符数。",
  "insight": "dp[end] 表示前 end 个字符的最少额外数。默认把最后一个字符当额外得到 dp[end-1]+1；再枚举 start，若 s[start..end) 在字典中，就可用 dp[start] 覆盖该段并更新。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "字典单词可重复使用",
    "所选单词不能重叠但可相邻",
    "默认转移保证任意字符都能作为额外字符"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "prefix-dp-with-dictionary-substrings",
      "title": "前缀动态规划枚举结尾单词",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "对每个前缀尝试所有可能的最后一个字典词。",
      "steps": [
        "dictionary 转哈希集合",
        "dp[0]=0",
        "end 从一到 n",
        "dp[end]=dp[end-1]+1",
        "start 从零到 end-1，若 substring(start,end) 在集合，dp[end]=min(dp[end],dp[start])",
        "返回 dp[n]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n³) including substring copies",
        "space": "O(n + dictionary)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/prefix-dp-with-dictionary-substrings/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/prefix-dp-with-dictionary-substrings/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/prefix-dp-with-dictionary-substrings/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
